---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Disclosure" description="Factory Signal affiliate, advertising, and editorial disclosure." pathname="/disclosure/">
  <main><article class="article-body">
    <h1>Disclosure</h1>
    <p>Factory Signal may eventually earn money from advertising, affiliate links, sponsorships, subscriptions, or other commercial relationships.</p>
    <p>Advertising placeholders are disabled by default and only render when advertising environment variables are configured. Affiliate links and sponsored placements should be clearly labeled when added.</p>
    <p>Automated briefings summarize and link to public third-party content. Original articles should be produced as Factory Signal editorial content and should distinguish reporting, analysis, opinion, affiliate recommendations, and sponsorships.</p>
  </article></main>
</Base>
